"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.4 Stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.3.2) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 Pro - Apple M2 Pro (10 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot 4.4 Stable (Mac)\nEditor Settings > Run > Window Placement\nWhen Rect is set to Force Maximized and Screen is set to the second monitor, running the game still only shows on primary monitor. The setting is not activating under this circumstance but does work when Rect is set to Centered. Please fix this bug as it is a quality of life issue when using 2 monitors to build a game.\nScreenshot included.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1091f8c5-7446-4c8e-af63-53e41a44c081)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nGodot 4.4 Stable (Mac)\nEditor Settings > Run > Window Placement\nSet Rect to: Force Maximized\nSet Screen to: Second monitor\nNow attempt to run the game and it will not respect the changes.\nWill only open on primary monitor, blocking the editor in a dual monitor workflow.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104245/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}